      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">An ebony drachiri nurtured your egg to growth, and you gain qualities well adapted to living in magmatic or cavernous terrain, with jagged, spiny or spiked bodies that are either heavy-set or sharp and angular and sharp eyes that see in its depths. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.NlGzXdfbf3IsupSJ]{Exemplary Qualities} feat. You gain darkvision and gain a climb speed equal to your Fly speed.</span></p>"
